# The Hoplock Proxy revision the end-to-end topology builds (PLAN §9, 0061).
#
# Pinned, and recorded here, so that a failing scenario is attributable to a
# change on ONE side: this file moves only in a commit that says so, and a
# commit that changes nothing on this side but this line is a proxy change.
#
# It is deliberately NOT contract/UPSTREAM. That file pins the document this
# server implements (M1); this one pins the proxy binary the suite runs against.
# The two may differ, and `deploy/build.sh` refuses a pair whose api/control.yaml
# differs from the vendored copy — a proxy speaking another contract would make
# every disagreement look like a bug on whichever side the reader suspects.
#
# To move it: put the new commit below, run `make e2e`, and commit both the pin
# and whatever the suite needed in one PR (deploy/README.md, "Moving the pin").
